 Low Level Steps (Hands-On Implementation Steps)


 LOW LEVEL DESIGN (LLD) STEPS TO BUILD A GCP AI AGENT
 PHASE 1 — GCP Setup
1. Create a project
gcloud projects create my-ai-agent-project
gcloud config set project my-ai-agent-project

2. Enable required APIs
gcloud services enable aiplatform.googleapis.com run.googleapis.com artifactregistry.googleapis.com secretmanager.googleapis.com

3. Create a Service Account
gcloud iam service-accounts create ai-agent-sa

4. Grant permissions
gcloud projects add-iam-policy-binding PROJECT_ID \
  --member=serviceAccount:ai-agent-sa@PROJECT_ID.iam.gserviceaccount.com \
  --role=roles/aiplatform.user

gcloud projects add-iam-policy-binding PROJECT_ID \
  --member=serviceAccount:ai-agent-sa@PROJECT_ID.iam.gserviceaccount.com \
  --role=roles/run.admin

gcloud projects add-iam-policy-binding PROJECT_ID \
  --member=serviceAccount:ai-agent-sa@PROJECT_ID.iam.gserviceaccount.com \
  --role=roles/artifactregistry.reader

 PHASE 2 — Vector DB (RAG Setup)
1. Create project folders
mkdir ai-agent
cd ai-agent
mkdir app rag_data chroma_db

2. Install dependencies

FastAPI

LangChain

LangChain-Google-VertexAI

Vertex AI

Chroma

pip install fastapi uvicorn langchain langchain-google-vertexai google-cloud-aiplatform chromadb

3. Prepare data

Put any .txt, .md, .yml, .json, .pdf (after text extraction) inside rag_data/.

4. Build RAG index

Run script to create embeddings using Gemini:

python -m app.rag_ingest

 PHASE 3 — Build Agent Logic Using LangChain
1. Define Tools

Examples:

GitHub workflow trigger

BigQuery query

Slack message sender

File search

2. Define agent LLM

Using Gemini Flash / Pro:

llm = ChatVertexAI(model_name="gemini-1.5-flash")

3. Build the agent

Use LangChain's agent:

agent = initialize_agent(tools, llm, agent="chat-conversational-react-description")

4. Create FastAPI app

Expose endpoint:

@app.post("/agent")
def run_agent(req: Prompt):
    return {"response": agent.run(req.prompt)}

PHASE 4 — Containerize the Agent
1. Create Dockerfile
FROM python:3.11-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt
COPY . .
CMD ["uvicorn", "app.main:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8080"]

2. Build & Push Image
gcloud builds submit --tag gcr.io/PROJECT_ID/ai-agent

 PHASE 5 — Deploy to Cloud Run
1. Deploy
gcloud run deploy ai-agent \
  --image gcr.io/PROJECT_ID/ai-agent \
  --region us-central1 \
  --allow-unauthenticated \
  --service-account ai-agent-sa@PROJECT_ID.iam.gserviceaccount.com

2. Set environment variables

GCP_PROJECT

GITHUB_REPO

GITHUB_WORKFLOW

SERVICE_PATH

3. Add secrets

GitHub Token

Slack Webhook

 PHASE 6 — Test the Agent
Test with CURL:
curl -X POST https://YOUR_URL/agent \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"prompt": "Run unit tests and show output"}'

Test RAG:
curl -X POST https://YOUR_URL/agent \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"prompt": "Explain the pipeline steps"}'
